---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import Waveform from '../Waveform.astro';
---

<section class="section relative">
  <div class="container-page grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="chip text-label-sm">Conversational AI</p>
      <h2 class="text-headline-lg mt-6 text-on-surface">No Phone Trees. No Robotic Scripts.</h2>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-5">
        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
          Customers can explain what they need in their own words. Ralvie understands natural speech and written
          messages, allowing conversations to flow without rigid phone menus or predefined commands.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
          It can ask intelligent follow-up questions when more information is needed and adapt the conversation
          based on each customer's response — for a faster and more personal experience across both voice and
          digital channels.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal glass-card">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Live conversation</span>
        <Waveform bars={5} />
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-body-md rounded-lg rounded-tl-none bg-surface-container-high p-3 text-on-surface">
          "I'm not sure if you can help — I need something fixed at my place sometime this week, maybe Thursday?"
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-md ml-6 rounded-lg rounded-tr-none bg-linear-to-br from-primary to-secondary p-3 text-on-primary">
          "I can help with that. What needs attention, and does Thursday morning or afternoon work better?"
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-outline-variant pt-4">
        <Icon name="sparkles" class="h-4 w-4 text-secondary" />
        <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Ralvie adapts the next question to what the customer just said</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
